                                "sense_id": "ce1bb1d7-c38d-3716-aa2f-09da37bbcd93",
                                "text": "Subjects were selected on the basis of 'affinitive' relationships, a notion which is defeined by Maisonneuve (1966; Maisonneuve & Lamy, 1993) as reciprocal choices associated with shared emotional satisfaction."
